  "description": "<h2>ENGWE N1 Air Features</h2>\n<p>1. 250W In-Rotor Motor</p>\n<p>2. Lightweight (15.6kg) &amp; Durable Carbon Fiber Frame</p>\n<p>3. Removable 10Ah Samsung Battery &amp; Up to 100 km of Long Range Riding</p>\n<p>4. Abnormal Bic Alerts, Built-in GPRS Tracking &amp; Automatic SOS Emergency Notification</p>\n<p>5. Step Through &amp; Step Over Options</p>\n<h2>What About ENGWE N1 Air?</h2>\n<p>The ENGWE N1 Air is the ultimate city e-bike, offering a lightweight and durable carbon e-bike frame that redefines urban commuting.</p>\n<p>Weighing just 15.6kg, this is the lightest e-bike in its class, built with a one-piece molded carbon fiber frame that provides 11 times the strength of aluminum. Perfect for city riders, the N1 Air offers a remarkable 100km range on a single charge, thanks to its high-capacity 10Ah Samsung battery. In addition to its long range, the battery of this commuter e-bike is also easy to remove. It can be removed in seconds and is very convenient to recharge.</p>\n<p>As a smart e-cycle, the N1 Air features an advanced anti-theft system with built-in GPRS tracking, abnormal bike alerts, and SOS notifications for extra security. Its 250W mid-drive motor delivers powerful yet discreet performance, ideal for navigating the urban jungle. Whether you choose the step-over or step-through design, this carbon e-bike ensures comfort and style. With a torque sensor that adapts to your pedaling force, the N1 Air provides smooth, responsive power for a truly seamless ride. The N1 Air is the perfect choice for anyone seeking the best entry-level city e-bike without compromising on performance or security.</p>\n<h2>ENGWE N1 Air Carbon E-bike Spec</h2>\n<table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"163\">Material</td>\n<td width=\"285\">Carbon Fiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor</td>\n<td>250W MIVICE Brushless Mid-drive Motor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Torque</td>\n<td>40 Nm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sensor</td>\n<td>Torque Sensor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brake</td>\n<td>160mm Front &amp; Rear Mechanical Disc Brakes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top Speed</td>\n<td>25 km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Mileage</td>\n<td>100 km (PAS 1 Level)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Battery</td>\n<td>36V 10Ah Samsung Removable Lithium-ion Battery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging Time</td>\n<td>About 5-8 hours</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tires</td>\n<td>700*38C Spoke Tires</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transmission System</td>\n<td>Shimano 7-speed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lights</td>\n<td>Front Light &amp; Solar Tail Light</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Climbing Degree</td>\n<td>10\u00b0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>LCD Color Display</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bike Weight</td>\n<td>15.6 kg (34.39 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gross Weight</td>\n<td>25.4 kg (55.99 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rider Height</td>\n<td>N1 Air: 5.25 ft - 6.4 ft;<br>N1 Air ST: 5.1 ft - 6.2 ft</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Payload Capacity</td>\n<td>N1 Air: 120 kg (264.5 lbs);<br>N1 Air ST: 100 kg (220.4 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
